# 🚀 Workspace-Transfer: Token-Efficient AI Collaboration

**Quick-start guide for AI models and human developers**

---

## ⚡ For AI Models: Token-Efficient Entry

### First Time / Fresh Clone

```bash
bin/init                         # Initialize workspace (~500 tokens)
cat .user/local/STATUS          # Quick overview (~200 tokens)
bin/checkpoint --brief           # Creative principles (~300 tokens)
```

**Total**: ~1k tokens (vs ~24k without optimization)

### Resume Existing Work

```bash
cat .user/local/CURRENT          # Recent activity + todos + research
bin/todo list                    # Pending tasks
bin/research list                # Pending questions
```

**Total**: ~300-500 tokens (vs ~2k re-explaining context)

### Before Starting Feature Work

```bash
# Check dependencies for your session type
bin/deps check <profile>         # visualization|filesystem|network|learning

# If missing
bin/deps install <profile>       # One-command install

# Session types:
# - visualization: gnuplot, ImageMagick, graphics libs
# - filesystem: FUSE development
# - network: SSL, networking libs
# - learning: SQLite, DBI
# - base: Core dependencies
```

