## 🎯 Token-Efficient Workflows

### During Work

```bash
# Track tasks (persists across sessions)
bin/todo add "Implement feature X" high
bin/todo list
bin/todo done <id>

# Defer research questions (avoid context bloat)
bin/research ask "How does Y work?" medium
bin/research list

# Track token usage
bin/track-tokens <task> <tokens>
bin/session-tokens add <N>
bin/suggest-handover              # Check if handover recommended
```

### Commit & Push

```bash
git add -A
git commit -m "Description"
bin/push-to-base                   # Automated PAT auth + push to base
```

### Session Handover

```bash
# At natural checkpoint
git add -A && git commit -m "WIP: Current state"
bin/push-to-base
bin/session-tokens reset

# Next session resumes with:
cat .user/local/CURRENT
# Shows pending todos, research, recent work
```

