## 🛠️ Available Tools

### Context Management
- `bin/todo` - Persistent task tracking across sessions
- `bin/research` - Question deferral system

### Dependency Management
- `bin/deps` - Profile-based pre-flight checks and installation

### Token Tracking
- `bin/track-tokens` - Track usage with positive reinforcement
- `bin/suggest-handover` - Proactive handover recommendations
- `bin/token-report` - Analytics and trends

### Git Automation
- `bin/push-to-base` - Automated push with PAT auth

### Status Automation
- `bin/update-status` - Regenerate .user/local/ summaries

---

## 💡 Philosophy

**Token efficiency through automation**:
- Scripts remember policies, models don't need to
- Offload computation from context to code
- Persistent state eliminates re-explanation
- Self-optimizing feedback loops

**Compound efficiency**:
- Small savings (500 tokens) × many sessions (100) = huge impact (50k tokens)
- Every optimization pays dividends across all future sessions

